# Comet Kernel for Exynos 7420 ☄️

> Based on [Haldexx/android_kernel_samsung_universal7420](https://github.com/Haldexx/android_kernel_samsung_universal7420)

A custom Android kernel tailored for Samsung Exynos 7420 devices, specifically optimized for the **HalleyOS** project (One UI 7 / Android 15). 

## 📱 Supported Devices
- Samsung Galaxy Note 5 (SM-N920X)
- Samsung Galaxy S6 Edge+ (SM-G928X)
- Samsung Galaxy S6 / S6 Edge (SM-G92X)
- Samsung Galaxy A8 2016 (SM-A810X)

## 🛠️ How to Compile
To build the kernel, simply run the provided `comet.sh` script in your terminal:

```bash
./comet.sh
